# Contact hover label animation

The desktop contact FAB hover label (`ContactOrbCursorMorph`) must animate **by character**, not by word.

## Required behavior

- Split label text into per-character spans (`data-contact-label-char`)
- GSAP enter: stagger `from: 'end'` (right-to-left, toward the button)
- GSAP exit: stagger `from: 'start'` (left-to-right)
- Spaces use a dedicated wider char wrap (`contact-hover-label__char-wrap--space`) for word spacing

## Do not

- Switch to word-level or whole-phrase-only reveal unless the user explicitly asks to change this
